==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*4 [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Bannerman Doge]] spawns.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Let the Cat Base tank for a bit, then once the enemies begin gathering up, send out a [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] to start cleaning them up. Protect him with a few [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]], then get out a second one before they trigger the boss wave. Dagshund should hopefully die almost instantly your dragons move onto the enemy base for a swift victory.

